## 코드 - User 모듈

<a id="339eda9b0fe18099b5c0fbe6a6d576dc"></a>

### **강의 코드**

[fastcampus-promotion-project/PROJECT-PROMOTION/promotion/user-service at main · dobby-teacher/fastcampus-promotion-project]()

- config
    <details>
    <summary>\[코드\] PasswordEncoderConfig</summary>

    <a id="33eeda9b0fe18098ae5cdfb2f3d4eda7"></a>

    ```java
    package com.fastcampus.userservice.config;

    import org.springframework.context.annotation.Bean;
    import org.springframework.context.annotation.Configuration;
    import org.springframework.security.crypto.bcrypt.BCryptPasswordEncoder;
    import org.springframework.security.crypto.password.PasswordEncoder;

