    		@Override
    	  public void fly() {
    	      System.out.println("Sparrow is flying");
    	  }
    }
    ```

    </details>

    <details>
    <summary>펭귄(Penguin) - 날 수 없음</summary>

    <a id="11aeda9b0fe18022a9e8f16fb26d99a6"></a>

    ```java
    public class Penguin extends Bird {
        // Penguins do not implement Flyable
    }
    ```

    </details>

    </details>

